+# Implementation instructions
+
+1. Prefer the smallest adapter or template needed for a task.
+2. Store only task-relevant context locally, with an explicit retention decision.
+3. Keep credentials out of client-side bundles, logs, notes, and exports.
+4. Require verified checks and human review before changes reach the main branch.
+5. Report failed checks and missing evidence without auto-resolving them.
